{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":13.28},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.8,"end":27.12},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.52,"end":41.76}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.12,"text":"同一路徑在不同週期下有不同感受。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.6,"end":6.8,"text":"縮短週期會提高平均移動速度，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.08,"end":8.56,"text":"不需要改變高度。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.96,"end":13.28,"text":"因此時間安排是獨立於姿勢的設計決策。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.8,"end":15.6,"text":"固定高度，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":17.84,"text":"比較 1 秒與 2 秒週期。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.28,"end":20.56,"text":"在相同時間比例暫停，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.8,"end":21.68,"text":"比較姿勢。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23,"end":25.44,"text":"路徑固定、週期減半時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.92,"end":27.12,"text":"什麼會改變？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.52,"end":31.12,"text":"路徑固定、週期減半時，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.52,"end":32.8,"text":"什麼會改變？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.4,"end":38.72,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.2,"end":41.76,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}